{"id": "86014", "name": "CR-Int-12-definite-1.b", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "Evaluate the following definite integral:\n\\[ \\int^{{CT:0}}_{{CT:1}}{{CT:2}}d{{CT:3}}. \\]\n\n[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]\n", "generalfeedback": "If \\[\\int f(x) dx = F(x)+c\\] then \\[\\int^a_b f(x) dx = F(a) - F(b).\\]\n\nSo, in order to calculate the definite integral of {{CT:4}} with respect to {{CT:5}} we first calculate its integral:\n\n\\[\\int {{CT:2}} d{{CT:3}} = {{CT:6}}+c.\\]\n\nSo, let \\[F({{CT:3}}) = {{CT:6}}\\]\n\nThen,\n\\[\\begin{array}{rcl}\\displaystyle\n \\int^{{CT:0}}_{{CT:1}} {{CT:2}} d{{CT:3}} &\\displaystyle =&\\displaystyle  F({{CT:0}}) - F({{CT:1}}) \\\\\n   &\\displaystyle =&\\displaystyle  {{CT:7}} - {{CT:8}} \\\\\n   &\\displaystyle =&\\displaystyle  {{CT:9}}\n \\end{array}\\] ", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<span class='correct'>Correct answer, well done.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class='partially'>Your answer is partially correct.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class='incorrect'>Incorrect answer.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "int(p,v,rdm2,rdm3)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "Alg